/F1 16 Tf (Oracle Fusion: New Year Setup Checklist) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
T* () Tj
T* (Before the year starts) Tj
T* ([ ] Extend the accounting calendar on every ledger \(incl. adjustment period\)) Tj
T* ([ ] Extend the budget calendar \(separate from accounting calendar\)) Tj
T* ([ ] Create new journal/reporting sequence versions \(gapless statutory\)) Tj
T* ([ ] Create document sequences + category assignments \(AP, AR\)) Tj
T* ([ ] Fixed Assets: asset fiscal year, depreciation calendar, prorate conventions) Tj
T* ([ ] Keep the asset fiscal year at least one year ahead) Tj
T* ([ ] Create and load the new year control budgets \(budgetary control\)) Tj
T* ([ ] Plan encumbrance carry forward of open commitments \(if used\)) Tj
T* ([ ] Copy GL periods into the cost/inventory calendar) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (At the rollover) Tj
T* ([ ] Open the first period of each ledger \(year-end roll happens automatically\)) Tj
T* ([ ] Open each subledger separately \(AP, AR, Assets, Cash Management\)) Tj
T* ([ ] Open cost/inventory periods \(only after matching GL period is open\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Owned by specific teams) Tj
T* ([ ] Final depreciation + asset period close \(asset/finance users\)) Tj
T* ([ ] Tax rate changes \(tax team, only when the authority issues them\)) Tj
T* ([ ] Period opening \(GL team\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Commonly missed) Tj
T* ([ ] FA fiscal year stops at upcoming year -> depreciation fails) Tj
T* ([ ] Budget calendar extended but control budgets not loaded) Tj
T* ([ ] Missing journal sequence version or document sequences) Tj
T* ([ ] Subledger periods forgotten \(GL period looked healthy\)) Tj
T* ([ ] Withholding tax calendar missing the new year) Tj
T* () Tj
